<title>JAPAN: TENNIS-JAPAN STAGES COMEBACK TO WIN FED CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-JAPAN STAGES COMEBACK TO WIN FED CUP.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan came back to win Sunday's</p>
<p>first Fed Cup tennis match with France after losing both</p>
<p>matches</p>
<p>on Saturday.</p>
<p>Results (French names first)</p>
<p>Mary Pierce lost to Ai Sugiyama 7-5, 6-7, 6-4</p>
<p>Saturday :</p>
<p>Mary Pierce beat Naoko Sawamatsu 6-0 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Nathalie Tauziat beat Ai Sugiyama 4-6 7-5 6-4</p>
</text>
